span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubOnSmallSubsets}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubOnSmallSubsets}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (club predicate on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\">\\([M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\\)</span> defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9InternallyClubModel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9InternallyClubModel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}club\\text{-}on\\text{-}small\\text{-}subsets}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClubOnSmallSubsets}_S(C,M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\nC\\subseteq[M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\n\\land\\forall a\\in[M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\\;\\exists b\\in C\\;(a\\subseteq b)\n\\land\\forall\\delta\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\to\\forall f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\delta,C)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in\\delta\\;(i\\in j\\to f(i)\\subseteq f(j))\n\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\in C\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}club\\text{-}on\\text{-}small\\text{-}subsets}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClubOnSmallSubsets}_S(C,M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\nC\\subseteq[M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\n\\land\\forall a\\in[M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\\;\\exists b\\in C\\;(a\\subseteq b)\n\\land\\forall\\delta\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\to\\forall f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\delta,C)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in\\delta\\;(i\\in j\\to f(i)\\subseteq f(j))\n\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\in C\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}internally\\text{-}club\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9InternallyClubModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land|M|=\\kappa\\land\\exists C\\;\\bigl(C\\subseteq M\\land\\mathrm{ClubOnSmallSubsets}_S(C,M,\\kappa)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}internally\\text{-}club\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9InternallyClubModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land|M|=\\kappa\\land\\exists C\\;\\bigl(C\\subseteq M\\land\\mathrm{ClubOnSmallSubsets}_S(C,M,\\kappa)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A size-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> model is internally club when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\cap[M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\">\\(M\\cap[M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\\)</span> contains an externally club family; the club family need not itself be an element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Clubness on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\">\\([M]^{&lt;\\kappa}\\)</span> is expanded as inclusion-unboundedness and closure under nonempty increasing unions of length below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2}